---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import BookingBanner from '../components/BookingBanner.astro';
import {treatments} from '../data/treatments';
import {whatsappBookingUrl} from '../data/clinic';
const bookingUrl = whatsappBookingUrl('/pricing/');
---
<Layout title="Dental Treatment Costs & Planning | 32 Whites Pune" description="Understand what affects dental treatment costs at 32 Whites in Keshavnagar. Prepare questions about materials, procedures, estimates and follow-up care." breadcrumbs={[{name:'Costs & planning',path:'/pricing/'}]}>
  <div class="container"><section class="page-hero"><span class="eyebrow">Plan with the full picture</span><h1>Know what you’re paying for.<br/><span class="soft-text">Before treatment starts.</span></h1><p>A root canal quote may include different things from the next one. An implant estimate may separate the surgery and crown. Compare the complete plan: the procedure, materials, appointments and follow-up. Confirm the consultation fee when booking, then request an itemised treatment estimate.</p></section><div class="content-grid"><article class="article-content"><section><h2>Five things your estimate should make clear</h2><ul><li>The recommended procedure and any alternatives.</li><li>Materials, laboratory work and the clinician carrying out the treatment.</li><li>Examination, imaging, temporary restorations and additional procedures.</li><li>Follow-up visits, maintenance and possible future replacement.</li><li>Payment arrangements and what could change the estimate.</li></ul></section><section><h2>Look beyond the treatment’s headline price</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table class="pricing-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Treatment</th><th scope="col">What to clarify</th></tr></thead><tbody>{treatments.filter(t => ['root-canal-treatment','dental-implants','braces-aligners','crowns-bridges','dental-cleaning'].includes(t.slug)).map(t => <tr><td><a href={`/services/${t.slug}/`}>{t.name}</a></td><td>{t.cost}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div></section><section class="notice"><h2>Your teeth determine the plan and the price</h2><p>The clinic does not publish a fixed price list here. A useful estimate follows an assessment of your teeth, health and chosen options. Ask for the current consultation fee and the complete breakdown before proceeding.</p></section><section><h2>Read before comparing estimates</h2><a class="text-link" href="/blog/understanding-dental-treatment-costs/">Our guide to understanding dental treatment costs<Icon name="arrow" size={16}/></a></section></article><aside class="content-aside" aria-labelledby="aside-heading"><h2 id="aside-heading">Make the cost conversation count</h2><p>Ask about the scope of your treatment, expected visits and what is included.</p><div class="aside-cta"><a class="button button-dark button-block" href={bookingUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-track="whatsapp_booking_click"><Icon name="chat" size={18}/>Book on WhatsApp</a></div></aside></div></div><BookingBanner/>
</Layout>
